{"path":".agents/skills/comprehende/references/example.md","ref":"831ca5da9276ead82ada198ba2b928e62c3710f2","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":1,"text":"# Example review.json"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"3031fcfc72737b521d526fa4e8d268ff208f3e41","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792696630,"line":3,"text":"Optional filled sample. The field shape in `SKILL.md` is enough to write a document. Paths come from the `pregroup` draft, and so does `source`. When a file is split, `oldStart` and `newStart` come from that hunk's `@@` header."},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"ee9f79a7d6790f4e36ca9f027a1c799c3b386ced","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790349567,"line":5,"text":"- `login` depends on `cookie`. Both use `part` \"Session cookie\". The helper's test sits in `cookie` with the helper it checks."},{"sha":"123b37bed0b9c4dafff5b5a187a0f73192913854","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787409379,"line":6,"text":"- `docs` is a separate part, last in `suggestedOrder`, because it could have been its own pull request."},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":7,"text":"- Ticket #12 names why this work exists, so document `why` is present. Document `title` keeps the ticket title. Document `summary` names both stories. Document `parts` holds a one-sentence what per story. The why cites the ticket with `[#12](source:s1)`."},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":8,"text":"- `login` `summary` names how those hunks meet. `cookie` has a `contract` attention with its predicted trace, and `login` a `product` call. `docs` has no attention."},{"sha":"ca0b4898bbcde5007339818c8a1082ec94dedb93","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793519660,"line":9,"text":"- `cookie` and `login` each ask one question about a choice that no source explains. Ticket #12 already says why cookies are HttpOnly, so no question asks that; the answer is in `why`."},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":10,"text":"- `cookie` opens the long `session.ts` hunk on the lines that set the options, with a `focus` range. `login` pins one note to the line where `rememberMe` reaches the helper, because the code there does not say what the helper does with it. Both copy line numbers from `show`."},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":11,"text":"- Document `lookFor` compares ticket #12 with the diff: work the ticket asks for that no hunk does, and an item done differently. Both cite `[#12](source:s1)`."},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":12,"text":"- A refactor idea (`parseCookie` could reuse `splitHeader`), a nit (`opts` is a vague name), and a missing test (expired cookies) are not in the document."},{"sha":"885f5d551634c9c40408bdb65f7fbd58a5b29134","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792664421,"line":13,"text":"- Each group holds every hunk of its files, so each `hunkRefs` entry is a path. A split file uses `path@oldStart+newStart` (`old/path -> new/path@oldStart+newStart` when renamed). A directory of mechanical files the draft collapsed stays one `dir/` ref."},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":14,"text":""},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":15,"text":"```json"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":16,"text":"{"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":17,"text":"  \"version\": 1,"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":18,"text":"  \"source\": {"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":19,"text":"    \"baseRef\": \"origin/main\","},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":20,"text":"    \"headRef\": \"HEAD\","},{"sha":"3031fcfc72737b521d526fa4e8d268ff208f3e41","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792696630,"line":21,"text":"    \"range\": \"origin/main...HEAD\","},{"sha":"3031fcfc72737b521d526fa4e8d268ff208f3e41","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792696630,"line":22,"text":"    \"baseSha\": \"3f1c0a9d2b8e4c6f7a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5\","},{"sha":"3031fcfc72737b521d526fa4e8d268ff208f3e41","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792696630,"line":23,"text":"    \"headSha\": \"9b8a7c6d5e4f30211fedcba9876543210fedcba9\""},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":24,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"5c713233ac7998a896201cef62027b5b4e3a2bd7","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786706250,"line":25,"text":"  \"size\": \"small\","},{"sha":"ff0f5fae42df12fc5d0b073309336d2d26099a58","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787947290,"line":26,"text":"  \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":27,"text":"  \"why\": \"[#12](source:s1) requires login sessions that client scripts cannot read.\","},{"sha":"3942655921e194989f89d2c8457b194172c9ed83","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787411833,"line":28,"text":"  \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it. The README documents this behavior.\","},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":29,"text":"  \"parts\": ["},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":30,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":31,"text":"      \"name\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":32,"text":"      \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it.\""},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":33,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":34,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":35,"text":"      \"name\": \"README\","},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":36,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The README documents the new session cookie behavior.\""},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":37,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":38,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":39,"text":"  \"sources\": ["},{"sha":"725ab691f3849d9f95e75914afcf75da53c08cf7","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787244404,"line":40,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":41,"text":"      \"id\": \"s1\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":42,"text":"      \"kind\": \"ticket\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":43,"text":"      \"label\": \"#12\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":44,"text":"      \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":45,"text":"      \"gist\": \"Requires login sessions that client scripts cannot read.\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":46,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\""},{"sha":"725ab691f3849d9f95e75914afcf75da53c08cf7","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787244404,"line":47,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"725ab691f3849d9f95e75914afcf75da53c08cf7","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787244404,"line":48,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"db481f3c643558b8140ada24dbd8c0978b611d30","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789216668,"line":49,"text":"  \"lookFor\": ["},{"sha":"db481f3c643558b8140ada24dbd8c0978b611d30","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789216668,"line":50,"text":"    \"[#12](source:s1) also asks logout to clear the session cookie. No hunk touches `src/api/logout.ts`.\","},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":51,"text":"    \"[#12](source:s1) wants sessions that client scripts cannot read. Sessions issued before this change keep their old cookie until it expires; no hunk rotates them.\""},{"sha":"db481f3c643558b8140ada24dbd8c0978b611d30","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789216668,"line":52,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":53,"text":"  \"groups\": ["},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":54,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":55,"text":"      \"id\": \"cookie\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":56,"text":"      \"title\": \"Session cookie helper\","},{"sha":"3942655921e194989f89d2c8457b194172c9ed83","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787411833,"line":57,"text":"      \"why\": \"The login route needs one helper to apply the session cookie options.\","},{"sha":"ee9f79a7d6790f4e36ca9f027a1c799c3b386ced","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790349567,"line":58,"text":"      \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies the required options to session cookies, and its test checks them.\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":59,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":60,"text":"      \"attention\": {"},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":61,"text":"        \"kind\": \"contract\","},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":62,"text":"        \"note\": \"`setSessionCookie` throws when a caller passes `httpOnly: false`. A caller that needs a cookie scripts can read now fails at runtime.\""},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":63,"text":"      },"},{"sha":"ca0b4898bbcde5007339818c8a1082ec94dedb93","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793519660,"line":64,"text":"      \"questions\": [\"Why does the helper set `SameSite=Lax` and not `Strict`?\"],"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":65,"text":"      \"focus\": ["},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":66,"text":"        {"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":67,"text":"          \"path\": \"src/auth/session.ts\","},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":68,"text":"          \"side\": \"new\","},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":69,"text":"          \"start\": 18,"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":70,"text":"          \"end\": 31,"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":71,"text":"          \"caption\": \"`setSessionCookie` sets `HttpOnly`, `Secure`, and `SameSite`, and throws on `httpOnly: false`.\""},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":72,"text":"        }"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":73,"text":"      ],"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":74,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 0,"},{"sha":"ee9f79a7d6790f4e36ca9f027a1c799c3b386ced","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790349567,"line":75,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"src/auth/session.ts\", \"src/auth/session.test.ts\"]"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":76,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":77,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":78,"text":"      \"id\": \"login\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":79,"text":"      \"title\": \"Login route\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":80,"text":"      \"why\": \"[#12](source:s1) requires HttpOnly session cookies. The route must set them through the helper.\","},{"sha":"123b37bed0b9c4dafff5b5a187a0f73192913854","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787409379,"line":81,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The login route in `login.ts` uses `setSessionCookie` from `session.ts`.\","},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":82,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"7f143a7b7989e4bdf8ab8dbdafd7255fe3ac2a88","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788035496,"line":83,"text":"      \"sources\": [\"s1\"],"},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":84,"text":"      \"attention\": {"},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":85,"text":"        \"kind\": \"product\","},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":86,"text":"        \"note\": \"With `rememberMe = false` the cookie has no `Max-Age`, so the session ends when the browser closes. Decide whether that is the intended behavior.\""},{"sha":"6284efe1e3e79fd1ca0ddb2c1454594f4f5ef7f8","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793515095,"line":87,"text":"      },"},{"sha":"ca0b4898bbcde5007339818c8a1082ec94dedb93","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793519660,"line":88,"text":"      \"questions\": ["},{"sha":"ca0b4898bbcde5007339818c8a1082ec94dedb93","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793519660,"line":89,"text":"        \"Why does `rememberMe = false` drop `Max-Age` instead of setting a short expiry?\""},{"sha":"ca0b4898bbcde5007339818c8a1082ec94dedb93","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793519660,"line":90,"text":"      ],"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":91,"text":"      \"notes\": ["},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":92,"text":"        {"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":93,"text":"          \"path\": \"src/api/login.ts\","},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":94,"text":"          \"side\": \"new\","},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":95,"text":"          \"line\": 47,"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":96,"text":"          \"body\": \"`rememberMe` maps to `persistent`; the helper picks `Max-Age` from it.\""},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":97,"text":"        }"},{"sha":"6507719457d0eaeff8e9e3d247131a68ed28161d","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793520005,"line":98,"text":"      ],"},{"sha":"ce37ae12a31e89d85e5dc95b4196576d03c8042c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787406907,"line":99,"text":"      \"dependsOn\": [\"cookie\"],"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":100,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 1,"},{"sha":"9d04c1fada6972361ceeb2f8af6a3646322033e4","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790107747,"line":101,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"src/api/login.ts\"]"},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":102,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":103,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":104,"text":"      \"id\": \"docs\","},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":105,"text":"      \"title\": \"README wording\","},{"sha":"3942655921e194989f89d2c8457b194172c9ed83","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787411833,"line":106,"text":"      \"why\": \"The README still describes the previous cookie behavior.\","},{"sha":"123b37bed0b9c4dafff5b5a187a0f73192913854","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787409379,"line":107,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The README section on sessions matches the new cookie behavior.\","},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":108,"text":"      \"part\": \"README\","},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":109,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 2,"},{"sha":"9d04c1fada6972361ceeb2f8af6a3646322033e4","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790107747,"line":110,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"README.md\"]"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":111,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":112,"text":"  ]"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":113,"text":"}"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":114,"text":"```"}]}
